# KitchenSink (.NET)

Native bindings for kitchen_sink

The `KitchenSink` namespace binds the `kitchen_sink` native library through
source-generated P/Invoke (`[LibraryImport]`), so it's trim- and
AOT-friendly.

## Build

```bash
dotnet build
```

Reference this project from yours (`dotnet add reference KitchenSink.csproj`)
or pack it (`dotnet pack -c Release`).

## Loading the native library

The bindings load `kitchen_sink` with the platform's normal rules
(`libkitchen_sink.dylib`, `libkitchen_sink.so`, or `kitchen_sink.dll` next to the app or on the
library search path). Set `KITCHEN_SINK_LIBRARY` to a full path to load a
specific file instead.

